      "content": "But i feel really lightheaded and the cramps are actually pretty painful, like i can barely walk straight. i feel like traditional sports drinks are just sugar water and wont actually hit the levels i need after a workout that intense. if i dont take the potassium now i'm worried i might pass out or something. isn't 2000mg still within a normal range for someone who just lost a massive amount of electrolytes through sweat?",
