    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm just trying to avoid a long night in the ER if i can help it, i'm literally right here at home. i looked up some athlete recovery guides and they talk about electrolyte loading for heavy training phases. if i just split the dose up, like take one now and one in an hour, wouldn't that be safer and more effective at fixing the deficiency than just sipping on Gatorade? i really just want to know if the dosage itself is okay if i space it out.",
